<title>SPAIN: Popular says it gaining market share.</title>
<headline>Popular says it gaining market share.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said on Wednesday it had been gaining market share in the past year in its target domestic retail market.</p>
<p>&quot;In the past year-and-a-half our business has been evolving clearly better than the industry. We are gaining market share,&quot; technical director Manuel Martin told journalists.</p>
<p>Overall, the number of new clients was up 35 percent in the period 1996 to 1997 compared with 1995 to 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The market niche where we want to be is going great guns,&quot; Martin said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
